'''''Vatica scortechinii''''' is a species of [[flowering plant]] in the family ''[[Dipterocarpaceae]]''.<ref name=POWO>{{cite web |url= https://powo.science.kew.org/taxon/urn:lsid:ipni.org:names:321719-1 |title= Vatica scortechinii (King) Ridl. |author=<!--Not stated--> |date=n.d. |website=Plants of the World Online |publisher=The Trustees of the Royal Botanic Gardens, Kew |access-date=February 16, 2025}}</ref><ref name=COL>{{cite web |url= https://www.catalogueoflife.org/data/taxon/7FJR8 |title= Vatica scortechinii (King) Ridl. |author=<!--Not stated--> |date=n.d. |website=Catalogue of Life |publisher=Species 2000 |access-date=February 16, 2025}}</ref> It is a tree [[endemism|endemic]] to [[Peninsular Malaysia]]. It is an [[Endangered species]] threatened by [[habitat loss]].

